      "content": "a spark. that sounds nice. but sparks die out. there's just nothing left to burn. even if i tried to walk a path, there's no one left to walk it with. i'm just a ghost in a suit. it's not just about being lonely, it's about the fact that the person worth being around doesn't exist anymore. why bother trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken beyond repair?",
